          "description": "This bedtime story follows Koko the Koala on a seaside sleepover at Harmony Cove, where Michel introduces the magical music of the Seaside Slumber. With mermaid melodies, glowing waves and the soothing rhythm of the tide, this gentle tale celebrates friendship and the magic of the ocean at night. A calming coastal adventure designed to lull little listeners into peaceful, dreamy sleep.",
